WEBVTT

1
00:00:05,170 --> 00:00:09,300
Master, look, there is a village in front of you.

2
00:00:16,590 --> 00:00:18,510
All the little ones, kill and rob for me.

3
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:20,990
Except for women, I will kill everyone else.

4
00:00:22,470 --> 00:00:24,310
Women, here I come

5
00:00:24,310 --> 00:00:27,030
I'm going to kill ten this time

6
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:33,430
How can ten be enough when a rich man stalks a weakling?

7
00:00:33,630 --> 00:00:35,190
I can kill a hundred

8
00:00:36,940 --> 00:00:40,180
Then let's compete to see who kills more people.

9
00:00:40,580 --> 00:00:42,900
Let’s compete, who is afraid of whom?

10
00:00:43,900 --> 00:00:45,980
There are three little mice here

11
00:00:46,500 --> 00:00:49,670
Madam, you take the child and run away first. I'll stop him.

12
00:00:50,070 --> 00:00:51,630
I'll fight with you

13
00:00:53,110 --> 00:00:59,620
Mother's rich man
